Excellent, this is a goldmine. Key env config exposed in client bundle:
- `ROOBET_WS_API_URL: wss://api.roobet.com/`
- `ROOBET_WS_GQL_PRODUCT_PORT: 8087` and `ROOBET_WS_GQL_ADMIN_PORT: 8088` — GraphQL product/admin ports!
- `ROOBET_CRASH_WS_URL: wss://crash-gs.roobet.com/socket.io/`
- `ROOBET_BETBY_BRAND_ID`, PaymentIQ merchant ID, Contentstack tokens, VWO key, GitHub SHA, Turnstile sitekey

Note the exposed secrets: ContentStack delivery/preview tokens, Datadog client tokens — these are public keys generally, but the config url for fasttrack `https://am-events.fasttrack-solutions.com/api/v1/config/roobet` contains `/api/v1/config/roobet`.

The gql ports 8087 and 8088 are very interesting — GraphQL might be directly reachable on those ports on api.roobet.com. Let me probe the GraphQL endpoint. Also crash-gs.roobet.com is a dedicated subdomain (a game server) — new asset.

